
update ; Built a LSTM and GRUmodel for the prediction of the next words in the email


Model used LSTM and GRU for the next word prediction:


LSTM 1st Attempt

　　　LSTM perform good in next word prediction but it stratus to hallucinate the words after predicting 10 	words 

　　　Data used: 50-55 email dataset 

　　　Used the one hot encode 

　　　Perameters used:
　　　1.  used the dense layer dense=150
2.used dropout to prevent over fitting 
3.optimizer: addam , loss=categorical_crossentropy
4.Model =LSTM
5.Early stopping
6.Return_sequence=True

　　　The trainable parameters are 367,093(1.40mb)

　　　Model accuracy 98%

　　　Loss: 4%

　　　X-Data dimention:(1185, 36)
　　　Y-Data dimention: (1185, 143)

　　　Model training time: 2m 19.5s

